{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09595","headline":"送祈乐归河东 · 岑参","name":"送祈乐归河东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祁乐後来秀，挺身出河东。\n往年诣骊山，献赋温泉宫。\n天子不召见，挥鞭遂从戎。\n前月还长安，囊中金已空。\n有时忽乘兴，画出江上峰。\n牀头苍梧云，帘下天台松。\n忽如高堂上，飒飒生清风。\n五月火云屯，气烧天地红。\n鸟且不敢飞，子行如转蓬。\n少华与首阳，隔河势争雄。\n新月河上出，清光满关中。\n置酒灞亭别，高歌披心胸。\n君到故山时，爲谢五老翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}